TESTED: Did not launch the interactive opencode2 TUI (would block); verified via --version + target-selection probe. Did not test an actual SSH/login shell spawn, but the sourcing chain (~/.profile -> ~/.bashrc -> ~/.bash_aliases) is standard and was confirmed by the prior opencode-alias deliverable. Pre-existing unrelated working-tree changes (reviewer.md mode, sandbox/restrict.sh) left untouched; no repo commit (deliverable is in operator home, not the repo).","created_at":"2026-08-29T04:13:51.402114280Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:LKcxcY8ErII3ow2tdjEolL0oRExAkZLj6VIU4Cf0vsU","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg2i4aIKoWd/MjdlgxwIzpP8HLAqXTaHiEwqkQ2J/7hTUAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAGBIDRmCnkL2Sl9+X4LD26JLzttlpWBvjuN+r6rjDaYjmLkwFxEHp53Uu8QZ0+UQHI+PRRkWhnLIGVFkh3wZbBw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:LKcxcY8ErII3ow2tdjEolL0oRExAkZLj6VIU4Cf0vsU","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg2i4aIKoWd/MjdlgxwIzpP8HLAqXTaHiEwqkQ2J/7hTUAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQJ+n/m867rfOHIJcg5jC7hVAC4mc+d3L/ac75XmHmqQXlPaPcNe5ca45uNmtpEPNWU9ODBW4rUA23970e3wrnQ8="}
